Package: raylibr
Title: R Wrapper for 'Raylib'
Version: 6.0.0.9001
Authors@R: 
    person("Jeroen", "Janssens", email = "jeroen@jeroenjanssens.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5878-8924"))
Description: Wraps 'Raylib' (<https://www.raylib.com/>), a simple and easy-to-use
    C library for videogames programming. Provides R functions for 2D/3D
    rendering, audio, input handling, and GUI via 'raygui'.
